# The three instrument pages merged into one on 2026-09-21. These redirects are
# not politeness to old bookmarks — they are the only way to retire a URL on
# Pages at all.
#
# Deleting a file does not retire its path. Cloudflare serves `foo.html` at the
# extensionless `/foo`, and an edge copy of `/foo` outlives the deployment that
# produced it: `cache-control: public, s-maxage=604800`, so a week. There is no
# purge for it either — the dashboard's Purge Cache works per zone, and
# *.pages.dev is not a zone in this account. A 301 published here is the one
# thing that replaces the stale entry.
/bench            /dev  301
/bench.html       /dev  301
/setup            /dev  301
/setup.html       /dev  301
/audio-bench      /dev  301
/audio-bench.html /dev  301
